"""Question bank (version-controlled). Stable codes; bilingual text; display conditions.

Modes: "express" questions are always asked; "standard" questions are added in Standard mode.
Decision questions (section "decisions") are asked only for the policies the user selected (see
`app.catalogue.catalogue.DECISIONS`).

Condition mini-language (evaluated in engine.py):
  {"q": CODE, "any": [v, ...]}     answer (select or multi) contains any of the values
  {"q": CODE, "eq": v}             answer equals v
  {"q": CODE, "answered": True}    question has an answered (non-unknown) value
  {"all": [c, ...]} / {"anyof": [c, ...]} / {"not": c}
"""
